{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-3652dae08f45c9b148e3123628002a913c2c2ebd7b951dc4","family_id":"KR:002619","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288439","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288439","source_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","body_sha256":"eb355c3707f8fe0015a205e0fcb8d4f0e339fa34683fd69c70157bd70526f26c","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 19897, Feb. 28, 2007>\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date)\nThis Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.\nArticle 2 (Amendment of other statutes)\n(1) The Enforcement Decree of the Inter-Korean Exchange and Cooperation Act is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 51 (2), \"traffic tax\" is replaced by \"traffic, energy and environment tax\", and \"Traffic Tax Act\" is replaced by \"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act\"; in the main text of paragraph (3) of that Article, \"Traffic Tax Act\" is replaced by \"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act\".\nIn Article 52 (1), \"traffic tax\" is replaced by \"traffic, energy and environment tax\".\n(2) The Enforcement Decree of the Local Tax Act is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 146-14, \"amount of traffic tax\" is replaced by \"amount of traffic, energy and environment tax\".\nIn Article 146-15 subparagraphs 1 and 2, each occurrence of \"Traffic Tax Act\" is replaced by \"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act\", and each occurrence of \"traffic tax\" is replaced by \"traffic, energy and environment tax\".\nIn the former part of Article 146-18, \"Traffic Tax Act\" is replaced by \"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act\", each occurrence of \"amount of traffic tax\" is replaced by \"amount of traffic, energy and environment tax\", and \"traffic tax\" is replaced by \"traffic, energy and environment tax\".\nArticle 3 (Relationship with other Acts and subordinate statutes)\nWhere the former Enforcement Decree of the Traffic Tax Act or any provision thereof is cited by another Act or subordinate statute as at the time this Decree enters into force, if a provision corresponding thereto exists in this Decree, this Decree or the relevant provision of this Decree shall be deemed cited, in lieu of the former provision.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\dba82d66aa1d22d6b69590f4e7bd16b830d28eb146ec71365c0d4334cfbfbe7b.ascii.json","sha256":"dba82d66aa1d22d6b69590f4e7bd16b830d28eb146ec71365c0d4334cfbfbe7b"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"cf19e77b37845b4e392b289b786f431e8e8381a09b50cde4fbe248198a95e6de","unit_key":"addenda-14078-19931231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"22d6bff0ac4dc62bebb8e77c1770bb29c1c10d11b3f9444c4f89002eaca4eb3b","unit_key":"addenda-14438-19941223"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"2b35feb4c1ed36ceeeadf274d6f52c2280c45ec14b01a1c90f4ef330a3d28781","unit_key":"addenda-15970-19981231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"71296299738d57cb73bdd7d93eed97381847714de29e7088b53dfa49786f40cf","unit_key":"addenda-17319-20010730"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"e9f82a6e0fa95063830cd2194bca86b8d5c0bcdbec4ec513a406919974e49773","unit_key":"addenda-17644-20020629"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"41d8ad8f6ad045841010ed265b42f2f8a708ea9729256f68528af369587fc211","